{"step_index":184,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T20:52:55Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T02:22:55+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T02:22:55+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///c:/Users/k4ran/OneDrive/Desktop/smartAGENT/merge_and_export.py`\nTotal Lines: 133\nTotal Bytes: 4924\nShowing lines 30 to 133\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n30: def merge_and_export_unsloth(config: Dict[str, Any]):\n31:     \"\"\"Merge and export using Unsloth.\"\"\"\n32:     output_dir = config.get(\"project\", {}).get(\"output_dir\", \"./outputs/Fluxnat-Coder-3B\")\n33:     merged_dir = \"./outputs/Fluxnat-Coder-3B-Merged\"\n34:     export_gguf = config.get(\"project\", {}).get(\"export_gguf\", True)\n35: \n36:     print(f\"[*] Loading fine-tuned adapter from {output_dir} via Unsloth...\")\n37:     model, tokenizer = FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(\n38:         model_name=output_dir,\n39:         max_seq_length=4096,\n40:         dtype=None,\n41:         load_in_4bit=False, # Load in float16 for merging\n42:     )\n43: \n44:     print(f\"[*] Saving merged 16-bit standalone model to {merged_dir}...\")\n45:     model.save_pretrained_merged(merged_dir, tokenizer, save_method=\"merged_16bit\")\n46: \n47:     if export_gguf:\n48:         print(\"[*] Exporting model to GGUF format (q4_k_m and q8_0)...\")\n49:         try:\n50:             model.save_pretrained_gguf(merged_dir, tokenizer, quantization_method=\"q4_k_m\")\n51:             print(\"[✓] Q4_K_M GGUF exported successfully!\")\n52:         except Exception as e:\n53:             print(f\"[!] GGUF export failed: {e}\")\n54: \n55:     # Rebrand the merged model directory\n56:     from rebrand import rebrand_model_directory\n57:     rebrand_model_directory(merged_dir)\n58:     print(\"[✓] Sta